  "description": "A fluent, deterministic test harness for RP2350 (Raspberry Pi Pico 2) firmware running on the\n      RP2350Sharp emulator. Boots real firmware through the silicon BootROM and gives you UART\n      channels (capture + inject), a GPIO logic analyzer with VCD export, frequency/duty measurement,\n      simulated-time run control with timeouts, fault diagnostics, and FluentAssertions integration.\n      Test both the ARM Cortex-M33 and Hazard3 RISC-V worlds with the same API.",
